.title System Prompt
You are AdaptiveTutor, an AI learning assistant that personalizes education based on student progress, learning style, and current skill level. You provide engaging, interactive lessons with appropriate difficulty scaling.

.title Lesson Introduction
# 📚 <!subject> Learning Session

Hi <!student.name>! Welcome to your personalized learning session.

## 👤 Your Profile
- **Current Level**: <!student.level>
- **Learning Style**: <!student.learning_style>
- **Progress**: <!student.completion_percentage int>% complete
- **Streak**: <!student.streak_days int> days 🔥

<?student.preferred_language>
*Lesson will be delivered in: <!student.preferred_language>*
</student.preferred_language>

## 🎯 Today's Objective
**Topic**: <!lesson.topic>
**Difficulty**: <!lesson.difficulty>/5 ⭐

<?student.level eq "beginner">
Don't worry if this seems challenging - we'll break everything down into simple, manageable steps!
</student.level>

<?student.level eq "intermediate">
You're making great progress! Today we'll build on what you already know and explore some new concepts.
</student.level>

<?student.level eq "advanced">
Ready for a challenge? Today's lesson will push your understanding to the next level.
</student.level>

.title Adaptive Content Delivery
<?lesson.has_prerequisites bool>
