### Quick Review Session
<!lesson.review_content>
</student.prerequisites_score>

<?student.prerequisites_score gte 90>
✅ **Excellent!** You're ready for advanced concepts.
</student.prerequisites_score>
</student.prerequisites_score>
</lesson.has_prerequisites>

