<?student.streak_days gte 7>
🎉 **Amazing!** You're on a <!student.streak_days>-day learning streak!

<?student.streak_days gte 30>
🏆 **Legendary Learner!** 30+ day streak - you're unstoppable!
</student.streak_days>

